OL,3,GNEWSANew inquest into boy's death to
OL,4,Areview social media
OL,5,
OL,6,FA mother says she is pleased after a
OL,7,Fhearing named social media giants Meta
OL,8,Fand Snapchat as "interested persons" in
OL,9,Fthe second inquest into her son's
OL,10,Fdeath.
OL,12,FJools Sweeney, 14, from Cheltenham,
OL,13,Fdied in April 2022 in what his mother,
OL,14,FEllen Roome, believes was an online
OL,15,Fchallenge gone wrong.
OL,17,FFifteen social companies have now been
OL,18,Fasked to provide data and evidence, and
OL,19,FRoome, who has campaigned for this,
OL,20,Fhopes they will all be "willing to help
OL,21,Fand release everything they've got so
OL,22,Fthat I can hopefully get answers".
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
